Package: enigma2-plugins-remotechannelconverter-dreamos
Version: 2.0.2
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mardo22 (SetTvBox4U)
Depends: enigma2
Description: Remote channel stream converter 2.0.2 for DreamOS 4.5 and 5.0 (one package)
 Converts bouquets of another Enigma2 receiver into stream bouquets
 (OpenWebif without password or FTP with password), IPTV channels, StreamRelay, picon links, picons and EPG mapping.
 Based on the OpenPLi / OE-Alliance plugin. License: GPL-3.0.
